cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ContextDuty in your research or product, please cite it."
title: "ContextDuty: a local-first prompt firewall for AI workflows"
abstract: >-
  ContextDuty is a local-first prompt firewall that detects and redacts secrets
  and PII before they reach AI tools — across the IDE, git commits, live AI-API
  traffic, and MCP tool calls. Detection is powered by Microsoft Presidio plus
  deterministic regex detectors; enforcement runs entirely on the developer's
  machine.
type: software
authors:
